{"articleNo":"376965","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=376965&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] 국민취업지원제도 참여 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2022.06.15","hit":"10156","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmwehA2CEkA2A3AJgdQGICsBOA1ADwA0BhAS1QDsBBAsvAOgAdKBzIA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">취업취약계층에게 취업지원서비스를 제공하고 저소득 구직자에게는 생계안정을 위한&nbsp;</span></span></b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">소득도 결합하여 지원하는&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></b><b><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">한국형 실업부조제도인&nbsp;</span></span></b><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">『</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">국민취업지원제도</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">』 </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">를 시행하고 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">.</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">     </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">미취업졸업생과 마지막 학기 재학생들 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">(22</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">년도 중 졸업예정자는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">\"22</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">년도 중 참여가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">, \"23</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">월 졸업예정자는</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">    </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">22</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">일 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">, 23</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">월 졸업예정자는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">22</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">11</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">일 부터 참여 가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">이 본 사업에 참여할 수 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">.</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">참여유형에 따라 구직촉진수당 최대 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">300</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">만원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">(6</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">개월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">또는 직업훈련수당</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">취업성공수당 등 지급</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">.</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><b> </b></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">   </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(153, 0, 76);\">◆ </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(153, 0, 76);\">금오공과대학교 교내에서 본 사업 참여가 가능하니 적극적 참여 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(153, 0, 76);\">.</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(153, 0, 76);\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(153, 0, 76);\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">     </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">장소</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">금오공과대학 도서관 2층 209호</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">  </span><o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">    </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">일시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">: 22</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">월</spa